    "prose": "Safe playbook\nWritten from a built-in template.\nMove to the safest beacon, raise the priority of any beacon about to brown out, then stay with the safest beacon.\n\nRoute\n  1. to_safety: walk to the safest own beacon, avoiding known threats.\n\nRules\n  1. \"flee\", when the commander is at or below 40% HP and the commander took damage in the last 3 s:\n    1. flee_to_safety: walk to the safest own beacon.\n    2. flee_wait: hold for 8 s.\n    Then carry on with the route.\n    Fires at most 3 times, and no sooner than every 30 s.\n\nIf the commander dies\n  On respawn, carry on from the step the route was on.\n\nFallback\n  Stay with the safest own beacon.\n\nBudget\n  4 of 128 size units.\n  0 s standing at a beacon along the route.\n",
